{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_st02",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_st02",
  "title": "織錦緞",
  "storyCode": "HS-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4797d8b74a2061a2670dcc95e314c28591b0a87f38e49cba0f0f976656abf085",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經丑時了……這局是誰贏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己數數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都說過，我不擅長這事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你應該學學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要見你一面可不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這古寺深寒，二哥倒是不改其道……你天天把自己關在這屋子裡對著這副棋盤，到底在上面看出什麼來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你在那帳本上看到的，差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "棋盤上有同一種規則，棋盤外，也是一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天下熙熙，皆為利來；天下攘攘，皆為利往……二哥琢磨得通透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些年來，兄弟姐妹幾個，自從找到各自感興趣的事後，好像都活得越來越愜意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子好像終於參透了“武道”，轉身去北疆守城，大姐一夢千年四處神遊，好不自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是……除了那個姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多少年來……我還是為她不值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來是你最近的生意做得太順，才有功夫操心這麼多事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是最近才想明白一個道理，學會了一種活法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天地者，萬物之逆旅也，光陰者，百代之過客也……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人活一世，無非是找到一處寄託，名心不化，這一生也就過去了。壽命長短，也無所謂什麼差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是真的看透了，就不會坐在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你想說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想做的事，我能幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我也要借你一樣東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥何必客氣，只要是我有的，需要什麼拿去就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把你的命給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g7_fieldhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你運氣真好。花下一禾生……就叫你“禾生”吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後你就留在這吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_mini01_villagevacancy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的土地，種不出莊稼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到那些黑色的石頭了嗎，有這些東西在的地方，糧食長不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "種不出糧食，就有人要餓肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有許多人，許多年來都在想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要學習嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這可能會花很多時間，可能你付出了一生的努力，都不會看到結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便如此，你也不後悔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g2_desertedcityfield_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "最近發生了許多事，原本熟悉的土地彷彿已經變成了人們不認識的樣子。古老的田地馬上就要完成翻新，又偏偏天意弄人，災異不斷。\n田邊頹坐的職農抬起頭，雨水落在他的臉上，清涼，溫和。\n田裡伏倒的莊稼也挺直了腰桿，枝葉變回了青翠的綠色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神農，是神農……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神農真的回來了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g4_factory_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你怎麼躺在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒醒，喂，醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼又換上這身衣服了……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……現在是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離我們上次碰面過去了半天，你讓我去查糧倉裡的莊稼，還說自己要去找把大荒城搞得滿城風雨的罪魁禍首——怎麼倒在這了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那現在呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糧倉裡的莊稼有沒有被污染，找到污染源在哪裡了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一點都沒看到……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去到糧倉，發現之前夏收收上來的莊稼全都變成了詭異的紅黑色……不止這個，田裡的地都變成了板結的鹽鹼地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不知道怎麼回事，剛剛下了一場雨，土地全都恢復原狀，糧倉裡的糧食也變成了正常的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就好像，有誰用了誇張的源石技藝，把污染全都清除了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地下的污染？誰能做到這種事……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在，應該安全了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場雨……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍在哪裡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說……誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的老師呢？她在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天師府的老師有好幾位，你在說誰……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g5_factory_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都是你做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她消失了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底想做什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼要來問我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留在這裡，守在這裡，自始至終都是她自己的選擇。我何曾干涉過分毫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把她禁錮在這片土地千年之久的，難道不是“人”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是瘋了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和那個臭棋簍子是打算送死，還要拉上所有人陪你們一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我的妹妹們是真的在這人間玩得太久太開心，忘了自己到底是誰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這齣假裝自己不是異類的戲，你們還要演多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小夕……你在畫裡待了那麼長時間，心氣還這麼浮躁，這可不是當世第一的畫家該有的心境吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有年，這麼長時間，我還從來沒見過你這麼認真的樣子，原來你還是很在乎自己的兄弟姐妹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會殺了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我說過，我是來幫你們的……咳咳……你們為什麼，就不相信呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不是想要做成這個，能支持我們存在的能量的容器？“巨獸的心臟”？我來告訴你們它缺少什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別過來。如果還想要命的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在實在不太有功夫來解開這個誤會……只能稍微委屈你們一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g5_factory_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g5_factory_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼能控制這個裝置？你是什麼時候——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的能力本就是同源的，何況在怎麼對付自己的分身上，我專門學習了一些經驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多少是有些冒險的辦法，會有些副作用，也是無可奈何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也該大荒城有這麼一劫，總不能自己種下的惡因，最後全靠別人付出生命來收這個惡果……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哪有這樣便宜的好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人伸出手，一株漆黑的稻穗出現在掌中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“形”“意”“因果”，你們三人加起來，聽起來確實能做出一些逆天改命的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐她永遠是這樣，相信只要辛苦耕種灌溉，總能得出善果。相信這世上美多於醜，善多於惡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可為什麼生命降生時，總是伴隨著啼哭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人也好，獸也罷，羈弱的生命來到這蒼茫世上，感知到的第一種情緒，只能是恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該醒來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人將黑色的稻穗投入身前巨大的裝置。\n緊接著，一顆心臟跳動起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
